The expressions replacing Character.isJavaIdentifierStart/Part, isJavaLetter
and isJavaLetterOrDigit only allow letters and letter numbers (and digits and
ignorable characters for the latter), but no currency symbols, connecting
punctuation or combining marks (see the TODOs in character_refine_preprocesst).
All cases are results confirmed with the JVM.
